{"id":"jh1dkm9a605ownc2jaova4da0","title":"欧洲央行加息25个基点至2.50%并上调通胀预测","originalTitle":"Meeting of 9-10 September 2026","summary":"欧洲央行在9月货币政策会议上决定将三项关键利率上调25个基点，存款机制利率由2.25%升至2.50%。会议认为中东冲突推高能源价格，使通胀压力更持久，预计2026至2028年通胀率分别为3.0%、2.5%和2.1%，并强调将继续依据数据逐次决策。","reason":"会议记录呈现了能源冲击、通胀预测与经济韧性之间的权衡，可用于理解欧洲央行继续加息的政策依据。","source":{"name":"欧洲央行新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu//press/accounts/2026/html/ecb.mg261008~a10153d090.en.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-08T11:30:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-08T11:49:24.779Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-08T11:49:24.779Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布","利率"],"score":88,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b8699c4d-9e2b-4273-a611-6c8022d575e8","title":"欧洲央行9月再加息至2.50%，预计通胀2027年底回归目标"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b8699c4d-9e2b-4273-a611-6c8022d575e8","title":"欧洲央行9月再加息至2.50%，预计通胀2027年底回归目标"}],"topics":[{"slug":"rates","name":"利率与流动性"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fwGQkkYQecx4","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}